This crate translates UI Organizer (UIO), the NVSE plugin that manages the UI and HUD additions of
other mods, into Rust, with its author's permission (the maintainer, 2026-11-03: every mod author
gave it). Source: UI Organizer 2.30, https://github.com/jazzisparis/UIO-User-Interface-Organizer,
commit 426d963 (the source of the shipped ui_organizer.dll 2.30). No C++ is included.

Credits: UI Organizer is written by jazzisparis (Jef).

